      "primaryDisplayName": "Lot of Fortune",
      "description": "The Lot of Fortune (Tyche) is the most prominent of the seven Hermetic Lots. It signifies worldly circumstances, the body, material prosperity, and the overall condition of the native's life. By day: ASC + Moon − Sun. By night: ASC + Sun − Moon.",
